{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524780/extras/8986c837f8bf3b089470f69c4353097f.poster.avif?t=1768559982\" width=1170 height=840 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524780/extras/8986c837f8bf3b089470f69c4353097f.webm?t=1768559982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524780/extras/8986c837f8bf3b089470f69c4353097f.mp4?t=1768559982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed is survival. Sydless is built around constant rapid movement where every slide, jump, wall-run, and punch feeds your momentum. Combat and style are inseparable - hesitation kills, flow keeps you alive. Each level rewards skill, speed, precision, and control under non-stop pressure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524780/extras/5a0ac73398b271ed20d8a087375e206f.poster.avif?t=1768559982\" width=1170 height=840 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524780/extras/5a0ac73398b271ed20d8a087375e206f.webm?t=1768559982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524780/extras/5a0ac73398b271ed20d8a087375e206f.mp4?t=1768559982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only weapon is a bouncing ball. Punch it, redirect it, and let it ricochet through enemies and spaces. The faster it moves, the deadlier it becomes - and the harder it is to control. Every encounter is a volatile pinball-like game where mastery means reading chaos and weaponizing the environment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524780/extras/6796126dd20af7d59551f2346ba0a26e.poster.avif?t=1768559982\" width=1170 height=840 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524780/extras/6796126dd20af7d59551f2346ba0a26e.webm?t=1768559982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524780/extras/6796126dd20af7d59551f2346ba0a26e.mp4?t=1768559982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Diego, an overworked employee of Randy's Burgers - a 90s fast-food that has collapsed into a warped, hostile fever dream. Familiar spaces twist, stretch, and become unrecognizable as the anomaly takes over. The clients do not look like the forgettable faces you served earlier. And why is Franck, your boss, trapped in his office?</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3524780?t=1768559982","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524780/de206afae3506526a972c2edf3de2a0a10e581f5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768559982","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524780/649a34887afae90206076a482c195ab3c8ba448d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768559982","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524780/649a34887afae90206076a482c195ab3c8ba448d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768559982","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Includes bloody violence and gore in a stilysed setting."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3947930,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524780/extras/8986c837f8bf3b089470f69c4353097f.poster.avif?t=1768559982\" width=1170 height=840 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524780/extras/8986c837f8bf3b089470f69c4353097f.webm?t=1768559982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524780/extras/8986c837f8bf3b089470f69c4353097f.mp4?t=1768559982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed is survival. Sydless is built around constant rapid movement where every slide, jump, wall-run, and punch feeds your momentum. Combat and style are inseparable - hesitation kills, flow keeps you alive. Each level rewards skill, speed, precision, and control under non-stop pressure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524780/extras/5a0ac73398b271ed20d8a087375e206f.poster.avif?t=1768559982\" width=1170 height=840 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524780/extras/5a0ac73398b271ed20d8a087375e206f.webm?t=1768559982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524780/extras/5a0ac73398b271ed20d8a087375e206f.mp4?t=1768559982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only weapon is a bouncing ball. Punch it, redirect it, and let it ricochet through enemies and spaces. The faster it moves, the deadlier it becomes - and the harder it is to control. Every encounter is a volatile pinball-like game where mastery means reading chaos and weaponizing the environment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524780/extras/6796126dd20af7d59551f2346ba0a26e.poster.avif?t=1768559982\" width=1170 height=840 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524780/extras/6796126dd20af7d59551f2346ba0a26e.webm?t=1768559982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524780/extras/6796126dd20af7d59551f2346ba0a26e.mp4?t=1768559982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Diego, an overworked employee of Randy's Burgers - a 90s fast-food that has collapsed into a warped, hostile fever dream. Familiar spaces twist, stretch, and become unrecognizable as the anomaly takes over. The clients do not look like the forgettable faces you served earlier. And why is Franck, your boss, trapped in his office?</p></li></ul>","developers":["Opia Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524780/f3e82514c96eb604dd0ca416182fdc08f35e4b46/header.jpg?t=1768559982","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3524780/949371106/844c8468a2f3257a1e638788baddba6e5256e9ee/1758703129/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765298560","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3524780/949371106/844c8468a2f3257a1e638788baddba6e5256e9ee/